#: ../../source/user_guide/audio_resources.rst:2 54fc897abbda4ea693810008e0055a58
msgid "音频资源"
msgstr "Audio resources"

#: ../../source/user_guide/audio_resources.rst:4 a190011f8b9a4029b625b5bf383add74
msgid ""
":ref:`FmodAudioStream<class_FmodAudioStream>` 保存音频字节和创建设置。播放器使用它创建、缓存 "
":ref:`FmodSound<class_FmodSound>`，每次播放产生一个 :ref:`FmodChannel<class_FmodChannel>`。"
msgstr ""
":ref:`FmodAudioStream<class_FmodAudioStream>` stores audio bytes and creation settings. Players "
"use it to create and cache :ref:`FmodSound<class_FmodSound>`; each playback creates a "
":ref:`FmodChannel<class_FmodChannel>`."

#: ../../source/user_guide/audio_resources.rst:7 9e83bdc6d58f4aff846cd2148c573223
msgid "导入资源与运行时加载"
msgstr "Imported resources and runtime loading"

#: ../../source/user_guide/audio_resources.rst:9 756c6a7607fa43b7b8049328a4cc5287
msgid "项目内音频按 :doc:`../getting_started/quick_start` 导入为 FMOD Audio。将资源赋给播放器的 Stream，或通过导出属性在检查器中指定："
msgstr ""
"Import project audio as FMOD Audio as described in :doc:`../getting_started/quick_start`. Assign "
"it to a player Stream, or expose a resource property in the inspector:"

#: ../../source/user_guide/audio_resources.rst:11 f72fbb3d98ca436ca9516fe8cc493eb0
msgid ""
"extends Node\n"
"\n"
"@export var audio: FmodAudioStream\n"
"@onready var player: FmodAudioStreamPlayer = $FmodAudioStreamPlayer\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"func _ready() -> void:\n"
"    if audio == null:\n"
"        return\n"
"    player.stream = audio\n"
"    player.play()"
msgstr ""
"extends Node\n"
"\n"
"@export var audio: FmodAudioStream\n"
"@onready var player: FmodAudioStreamPlayer = $FmodAudioStreamPlayer\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"func _ready() -> void:\n"
"    if audio == null:\n"
"        return\n"
"    player.stream = audio\n"
"    player.play()"

#: ../../source/user_guide/audio_resources.rst:25 25a927acc98747b997c4c6f7d0329cc6
msgid "导出属性由 Godot 保存资源引用。脚本中固定引用已有资源时使用编辑器提供的 UID；外部文件路径由加载函数的参数传入。"
msgstr ""
"Godot stores the exported resource reference. For fixed script references, use the UID supplied "
"by the editor; pass external file paths as loader arguments."

#: ../../source/user_guide/audio_resources.rst:27 361d0cd5bcac42128c57ad692a668e61
msgid ""
"func load_audio(path: String) -> FmodAudioStream:\n"
"    return FmodAudioStream.load_from_file(\n"
"        path,\n"
"        FmodAudioStream.MODE_SAMPLE,\n"
"    )"
msgstr ""
"func load_audio(path: String) -> FmodAudioStream:\n"
"    return FmodAudioStream.load_from_file(\n"
"        path,\n"
"        FmodAudioStream.MODE_SAMPLE,\n"
"    )"

#: ../../source/user_guide/audio_resources.rst:35 bc180da41f034cae86b647888601b8c1
msgid ""
"``load_from_file()`` 通过 Godot FileAccess 读取原始文件，失败时返回 ``null``。从导出包动态读取原始文件时，需要将它包含在导出规则中；已导入资源使用"
" Godot 的资源引用加载。"
msgstr ""
"``load_from_file()`` reads a raw file through Godot FileAccess and returns ``null`` on failure. "
"Include raw files in export rules when loading them dynamically from an exported package. Load "
"imported assets through Godot resource references."

#: ../../source/user_guide/audio_resources.rst:38 7a304c04780449838d737db64ded3c29
msgid "Stream、Sample 与循环"
msgstr "Stream, Sample, and looping"

#: ../../source/user_guide/audio_resources.rst:43 4dfda20012664c2d9c66edd4218dc3e2
msgid "标志"
msgstr "Flag"

#: ../../source/user_guide/audio_resources.rst:44 7b8941e99f09412db9c0d20849436a97
msgid "用途"
msgstr "Use"

#: ../../source/user_guide/audio_resources.rst:45 c2e094a2b8044384ba5ec7b8a4adefd4
msgid "``MODE_STREAM``"
msgstr "``MODE_STREAM``"

#: ../../source/user_guide/audio_resources.rst:46 aa17e54d6b6241488581b9273778f54b
msgid "逐步解码，适合音乐和长音频"
msgstr "Incremental decoding for music and long audio"

#: ../../source/user_guide/audio_resources.rst:47 e8e051d45c3046e5920db8a2327e5828
msgid "``MODE_SAMPLE``"
msgstr "``MODE_SAMPLE``"

#: ../../source/user_guide/audio_resources.rst:48 07874b03bfd9420681fd6ad83c8953c7
msgid "解码为样本，适合频繁触发的短音效"
msgstr "Decoded samples for frequently triggered short effects"

#: ../../source/user_guide/audio_resources.rst:49 7e44ff12fa9b46aca5dd565da2f250a5
msgid "``MODE_LOOP``"
msgstr "``MODE_LOOP``"

#: ../../source/user_guide/audio_resources.rst:50 9831a0beb93c43baa464269ba52d4522
msgid "正向循环，可与 Stream 或 Sample 组合"
msgstr "Forward looping; combine with Stream or Sample"

#: ../../source/user_guide/audio_resources.rst:51 939dc6384a8545c7a2371a9bea222f45
msgid "``MODE_LOOP_BIDI``"
msgstr "``MODE_LOOP_BIDI``"

#: ../../source/user_guide/audio_resources.rst:52 d4ba0c9bdd5341279983ecdf6054a088
msgid "双向循环，需确认格式和加载模式支持"
msgstr "Bidirectional looping; verify format and loading-mode support"

#: ../../source/user_guide/audio_resources.rst:54 911b37fa71ec490fb5d20c33df93115f
msgid "Stream 与 Sample 选择其一，通过 ``|`` 添加循环标志。在播放前设置模式；修改模式会使缓存的 Sound 失效。"
msgstr ""
"Choose either Stream or Sample and add loop flags with ``|``. Set the mode before playback; "
"changing it invalidates the cached Sound."

#: ../../source/user_guide/audio_resources.rst:56 7cf3aaf2801744b9b0a157908d91075d
msgid ""
"func configure_music(audio: FmodAudioStream) -> void:\n"
"    audio.mode_flags = FmodAudioStream.MODE_STREAM | FmodAudioStream.MODE_LOOP"
msgstr ""
"func configure_music(audio: FmodAudioStream) -> void:\n"
"    audio.mode_flags = FmodAudioStream.MODE_STREAM | FmodAudioStream.MODE_LOOP"

#: ../../source/user_guide/audio_resources.rst:61 f971e8dcf80c4f6f88aea5cdd4802ecf
msgid ""
"``FmodAudioStream`` 在两种模式下都会保存音频文件字节，``load_from_file()`` 也会先读取整个文件。Stream "
"减少完整解码样本的内存开销，资源中的文件数据仍占内存。需要低层文件流时，可使用 ``FmodSystem.create_sound_from_file()`` 并指定 "
"``FmodSystem.FMOD_MODE_CREATESTREAM``。"
msgstr ""
"``FmodAudioStream`` retains file bytes in both modes, and ``load_from_file()`` reads the whole "
"file first. Stream mode reduces memory used by fully decoded samples; the resource file data "
"still occupies memory. For low-level file streaming, use ``FmodSystem.create_sound_from_file()`` "
"with ``FmodSystem.FMOD_MODE_CREATESTREAM``."

#: ../../source/user_guide/audio_resources.rst:64 c1212b957bb947f587611313723ad974
msgid "预加载与复用"
msgstr "Preload and reuse"

#: ../../source/user_guide/audio_resources.rst:66 769e32d50bad4c4b8940cad5a36e2175
msgid ""
"``preload()`` 提前创建内部 Sound。可在加载界面预加载常用短音效，或启用播放器的 "
"``preload_on_set_stream``。多个播放器可以共享同一资源，使用各自的播放通道。"
msgstr ""
"``preload()`` creates the internal Sound ahead of time. Preload common short effects on a loading"
" screen, or enable the player ``preload_on_set_stream`` property. Several players can share one "
"resource while using separate playback channels."

#: ../../source/user_guide/audio_resources.rst:68 d8aa8e396c4744ff80d2ccaed57ce270
msgid ""
"func prepare_audio(audio: FmodAudioStream) -> bool:\n"
"    if audio == null:\n"
"        return false\n"
"    return audio.preload()"
msgstr ""
"func prepare_audio(audio: FmodAudioStream) -> bool:\n"
"    if audio == null:\n"
"        return false\n"
"    return audio.preload()"

#: ../../source/user_guide/audio_resources.rst:75 d0ecd463a7e546d2a85c6f917330989b
msgid "通过导出数组维护音效或播放列表，可保留编辑器资源引用，避免每次触发都重新读文件。重叠播放和临时播放器的清理见 :doc:`playback`。"
msgstr ""
"Use exported arrays for sound collections or playlists to keep editor resource references and "
"avoid reading files on every trigger. See :doc:`playback` for overlapping playback and temporary-"
"player cleanup."

#: ../../source/user_guide/audio_resources.rst:78 ab5b0510202c429495d24936b47af8b5
msgid "从内存创建"
msgstr "Create from memory"

#: ../../source/user_guide/audio_resources.rst:80 e4e7eb4d136e4763b8c22c8a75466c4b
msgid "收到完整的编码音频数据后，赋给 ``audio_data``："
msgstr "Assign complete encoded audio data to ``audio_data``:"

#: ../../source/user_guide/audio_resources.rst:82 aff44eb7c7b1414aacc11baf7cb538c4
msgid ""
"func audio_from_bytes(data: PackedByteArray) -> FmodAudioStream:\n"
"    var audio: FmodAudioStream = FmodAudioStream.new()\n"
"    audio.mode_flags = FmodAudioStream.MODE_SAMPLE\n"
"    audio.audio_data = data\n"
"    return audio"
msgstr ""
"func audio_from_bytes(data: PackedByteArray) -> FmodAudioStream:\n"
"    var audio: FmodAudioStream = FmodAudioStream.new()\n"
"    audio.mode_flags = FmodAudioStream.MODE_SAMPLE\n"
"    audio.audio_data = data\n"
"    return audio"

#: ../../source/user_guide/audio_resources.rst:90 6e9b671667b9426cbbfb797ecb816bfc
msgid "普通 WAV、OGG 等编码文件可直接传入完整字节；无文件头的原始 PCM 还需要配置采样率、声道数和格式，参见 ``FmodAudioStream`` 的 Raw PCM 属性。"
msgstr ""
"Pass the complete bytes of encoded files such as WAV or OGG. Headerless raw PCM also requires "
"sample rate, channel count, and format settings; see the Raw PCM properties of "
"``FmodAudioStream``."

#: ../../source/user_guide/audio_resources.rst:93 aecdf754572d49c582a6f4a644a3d4ff
msgid "长度与生命周期"
msgstr "Duration and lifetime"

#: ../../source/user_guide/audio_resources.rst:95 b7deb389b0f1452e8438aa3c3b647109
msgid ""
"func print_audio_info(audio: FmodAudioStream) -> void:\n"
"    print(\"Data loaded: \", audio.is_data_loaded())\n"
"    print(\"Length in seconds: \", audio.get_length())\n"
"    print(\"Sound cached: \", audio.is_preloaded())"
msgstr ""
"func print_audio_info(audio: FmodAudioStream) -> void:\n"
"    print(\"Data loaded: \", audio.is_data_loaded())\n"
"    print(\"Length in seconds: \", audio.get_length())\n"
"    print(\"Sound cached: \", audio.is_preloaded())"

#: ../../source/user_guide/audio_resources.rst:102 55aa8e7a30004572a3b334d923d33171
msgid ""
"播放期间保留资源引用。``get_sound()`` 返回资源管理的缓存对象；低层播放时，也应保留对应资源直到通道结束。停止使用该资源的所有播放器后，可释放引用或调用 ``clear()`` "
"清空数据。"
msgstr ""
"Keep a resource reference during playback. ``get_sound()`` returns its managed cached object; "
"keep the resource alive until low-level playback channels finish as well. After all users stop, "
"release references or call ``clear()`` to discard data."

#: ../../source/user_guide/audio_resources.rst:105 e861fa1c9df4429eb1db53b7b0394276
msgid "相关页面"
msgstr "Related pages"

#: ../../source/user_guide/audio_resources.rst:107 a5c47c351600473b8f95d755b5d90ab3
msgid "播放与空间音频见 :doc:`playback`，总线配置见 :doc:`mixer`，导出过滤和运行库配置见 :doc:`../export`。"
msgstr ""
"See :doc:`playback` for playback and spatial audio, :doc:`mixer` for bus configuration, and "
":doc:`../export` for export filters and runtime libraries."
